The code in this directory (src/vidax/models/hunyuan_video/, all files and
subdirectories) is a JAX/Flax re-implementation of Tencent's HunyuanVideo and
HunyuanVideo-1.5 architectures, developed with reference to the upstream source
code at:

    https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HunyuanVideo
    https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/HunyuanVideo-1.5

That upstream source code is released under the Tencent Hunyuan Community
License Agreement, which is NOT a permissive open-source license (it includes,
among other terms, territorial restrictions -- it does not apply in the
European Union, the United Kingdom, or South Korea -- and acceptable-use and
commercial-scale conditions).

To the extent this directory is a derivative work of that upstream code, your
use, modification and redistribution of it is additionally subject to the
Tencent Hunyuan Community License Agreement, in addition to the Apache License
2.0 that covers the rest of vidax. See the repository-root NOTICE file, and the
upstream LICENSE.txt for the full, current text.

The same applies to the corresponding translator key mappings:
    src/vidax/translator/mappings/hunyuan_video.py
    src/vidax/translator/mappings/hunyuan_video1_5.py
